sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App
    participant Router
    participant LocalSLM
    participant LocalDB

    User->>App: Asks "Show Ramesh's balance"
    App->>Router: Route query
    Note over Router: Analyze query type
    Router->>LocalSLM: Simple query - local processing
    LocalSLM->>LocalDB: Query database
    LocalDB->>LocalSLM: Return data
    LocalSLM->>App: Generate response
    App->>User: Display answer